===Noun===
{{en-noun|inner children}}

# {{lb|en|psychology}} The [[childlike]] aspect of a person's [[psyche]] — typically, the personality and the memories of one's childhood — especially in context of coexisting with, and being [[suppressed]] by, an [[adultlike]] aspect of the person.

